bp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ae88a516bc6077ea0eb2ed13ea2a9246 2x, https://si.imgix.net/688a26c6/uploads/origins/0ba66a21-be6f-48cc-afca-601b9cf790b2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b2be7e21c7174d746bb82733bceecec1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "鴨ﾁﾞ先生、はじめまして！\n\n先生の作品は本当にかわいいです！もしよろしければ、リクエストをお願いしたいです。\n\n私のキャラクター、デリアとアビーを描いていただけませんか？二人は双子の姉妹ですが、デリアはもっと外向的で率直な性格で、アビーは控えめな性格です。\n\n可能であれば、このような作品を見たいです： https://skeb.jp/@hiiodiychan/works/31\n\nよろしくお願いします！ぜひご一緒できる機会があれば幸いです\n\n- Monsta\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/15ozi6l17oJKkvNtR5NvB40JTPOYfFaRD", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiiodiychan/works/31", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/39238d0a/uploads/origins/fa899b5b-eb03-4ae6-a2c2-54093c61a6b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d41c98c862082e518d90e8546387282", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/39238d0a/uploads/origins/fa899b5b-eb03-4ae6-a2c2-54093c61a6b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6d41c98c862082e518d90e8546387282, https://si.imgix.net/39238d0a/uploads/origins/fa899b5b-eb03-4ae6-a2c2-54093c61a6b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=426de3822379f32dde3ba61bd96822ec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/39238d0a/uploads/origins/fa899b5b-eb03-4ae6-a2c2-54093c61a6b7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a08a8c759d5a4e7111e62661f4bd6a81 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして！新着でみかけて惹かれました。\nもしよろしければオリキャラの子たちを描いて貰いたいと思います。\nネズミの天使の子はマイペースで、犬耳の悪魔の子は真面目で少しツンデレな子です。以下のURLをご検討お願いいたします。\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kQwZ1Yk6iwIOw8loT_NwPDscSTLdPJvp?usp=sharing\nポーズなどは先生にお任せ致します。よろしくお願いいたします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiiodiychan/works/30", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/e830e829/uploads/origins/86bf1dfb-099c-44e0-8200-971ffb9f7268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7353f43f8d456bfe00b0ee6d2fdfda4", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/e830e829/uploads/origins/86bf1dfb-099c-44e0-8200-971ffb9f7268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d7353f43f8d456bfe00b0ee6d2fdfda4, https://si.imgix.net/e830e829/uploads/origins/86bf1dfb-099c-44e0-8200-971ffb9f7268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=395539acde42e9463b30bdb3f068b9e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/e830e829/uploads/origins/86bf1dfb-099c-44e0-8200-971ffb9f7268?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0b472175e3ed2f3bf81a77aac214ce8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。vtuberをしている神野はくあと申します。\n新着でイラストを見て素敵だなと思いリクエストいたしました。\n\n使用用途：youtubeでのサムネイルやアイコンや動画での使用。\n納品形式：できれば背景が透過状態にできるPSDでお願いしたいです。\nその他：ポーズや表情はお任せします。サムネイルで使用したいので頭が見切れていない方が嬉しいです…！\n\n資料URLは自身の創作垢へのリプ状態になっています…\n\nご検討宜しくお願い致します。\n\nhttps://x.com/Raven_noah_/status/1972665995480449479", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiiodiychan/works/29", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3f33a62e/uploads/origins/d3e182dd-d0a7-46f4-b301-9a29fff4a872?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74bc440f81fb5aaf4fa7a2f87051173a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3f33a62e/uploads/origins/d3e182dd-d0a7-46f4-b301-9a29fff4a872?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74bc440f81fb5aaf4fa7a2f87051173a, https://si.imgix.net/3f33a62e/uploads/origins/d3e182dd-d0a7-46f4-b301-9a29fff4a872?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bfc08803ddeb7e116464b9a25a675668 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3f33a62e/uploads/origins/d3e182dd-d0a7-46f4-b301-9a29fff4a872?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f0d84bf89ace165e362667164fa4a1ea 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello! I really love the girls you draw — full of life and charm! I also adore your clothing designs, so I’d love to invite you to design a winter outfit for my OC 🩷\n\nPersonality: a willow spirit who took human form too early, she can’t fully understand emotions, so her expressions are often clumsy imitations.\nBackstory: after watching someone dear vanish in flames, she buried her in the soil, waiting for spring, believing she’d bloom again like flowers. Now she lives and works among humans, perhaps slowly softening.\nOutfit: a winter outfit with a very soft and cozy scarf 🥰 Everything else can be up to you, but I’d love for it to have a gentle, warm feeling — like the kind of clothes you’d wear after work on a cold winter day when stopping by a convenience store for hot oden (so cute…).  Hairstyle changes are fine ❤️❤️\nNote: her eyes are green with red 🥰\n\nI truly love your art and would be so happy to work with you 🥺💍 Thank you for reading!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1EmvDPp8nvzsw6RyvwsNc2aCAE0enbIJC", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@hiiodiychan/works/28", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c47b275/uploads/origins/beb9b5d9-bd63-445c-ae41-61efa83656b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eba8980c8c7cbad2bc991e9a1114f2eb", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c47b275/uploads/origins/beb9b5d9-bd63-445c-ae41-61efa83656b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eba8980c8c7cbad2bc991e9a1114f2eb, https://si.imgix.net/2c47b275/uploads/origins/beb9b5d9-bd63-445c-ae41-61efa83656b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2365e4a9aa509d74968b888593ce2819 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c47b275/uploads/origins/beb9b5d9-bd63-445c-ae41-61efa83656b8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1dacd9a572b739d59cb075022b2b06f2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "鴨ﾁﾞ様\n\n初めまして、八島と申します。\n\nこの度は新着で可愛らしいイラストを拝見し、一目惚れいたしまして……！\nぜひ